ded X1 (equal B (simpapply A B (simplambda A B F) X) (F X)) :- help/simpbeta A B F X X1.

help/simpbeta A B F X (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) :- help/simpbeta A B F X X1/1 , help/simpbeta A B F X X1/2.

